  unitName: Ryujin Mifune
  unitId: 60024
  unitNumber: 325
  description: An other-worldly samurai that appeared in the ruined Bariura Empire.
    Demonic blade in hand, Mifune found the death he so desired as he fought aggressively
    against the gods. However, the demonic blade he carried wouldn't allow him to
    pass on so easily. Together with his demonic blade that had already claimed so
    many lives, upon death Mifune's skills sharpened even further, and it's said
    he was then able to chop down gods in a single blow.
  summonDesc: So fortune has you summoning me!<br>Do you know the spirit within my
    blade?<br>If so, then I shall devote it to you.
  fusionDesc: Surely its beauty has faded.<br>But still, my blade continues to<br>demand
    more power.
  evoDesc: Even if my soul should perish,<br>my demon sword's soul remains.<br>It's
    always calling me to battle.
  element: 6
  rarity: 4
